        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          73 He Poubauhmei le, Nzianlou o",
            "                      9.9.9.8. Ref. 9. 9. 11.8",
            "          Doh hei E",
            "",
            "          1. He Poubauhmei le, nzianlou o.",
            "             Ai hei sansi liangmei paapcmei e.",
            "             Achaeng lwan hei zingc khithkhit key the:",
            "             Gaanhmei riw tei tiilou na ro.",
            "",
            "                  Arup 'ryan guay thu gaanhmei khou bam:",
            "                  Kaniw neihlaamei rui padik bam;",
            "                  Chwn siina bammei hei araana kumc the:",
            "                  He Poubauhmei 'zianlou na ro.",
            "",
            "          2. Kandih kabamv 'thuih khou tat sihnic,",
            "             Taanc niimei taanv guay taanc bam sihnic,",
            "             Akhou neihlaamei khatsihnic maek;",
            "             Apanty zingc haihhai key the.",
            "",
            "          3. He Poubauhmei Jisu, Nang khourui",
            "             Kaganv tingsaengcna leytat sihnic,",
            "             Ntaw thu Nang pamv khou guang dat the;",
            "             Ringhmei dui tizangvlou na ro."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
